# Dauntless Bodyguard enters on turn 3 with no other creature its controller controls: Bot2's Llanowar Elves are not
# Bot1's, and the Bodyguard is not "another" creature, so nothing is chosen and no choice is asked (CR 614.12a). A creature
# that enters later is not chosen either (the card's ruling: no new creature is chosen), so sacrificing the Bodyguard gives
# Ornithopter nothing.

